{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261114/photo/bkn-20261114161825704-1114_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261114162638\"/><p>今午(14日)1時05分，大角咀道73A號一單位，一名姓李(49歲)男住戶的家人報案，指與他失去聯絡。救援人員到場入屋，發現李男倒臥廁所內，經檢查證實他已經死亡。據了解，李男有身體病紀錄，不排除病發失救死亡。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T08:54:05.303046+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T08:18:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T08:47:30.241403+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T08:47:30.241403+00:00","content_hash":"af6fc0c8ed7c6c0936864097fcaebadb0043e3895b4e212421184882b0af00eb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}